      = (float)1;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t#endif\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t//
      Initialize built-in needed attributes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t#if HAS_STRIPS\n\t\t\t\t\t\tInitStripAttributes(index,
